        "agm_result": "Agenda #1: Approval of changes in the composition of the Board of Directors and Board of Commissioners, including the resignation of two commissioners, honorable discharge of several directors and the independent commissioner, and appointment of new members effective from 14 July 2026 to 13 July 2031. The decision was approved with a quorum of 79.76% and 99.99% in favor, with no votes against or abstentions.\nAgenda #2: Approval of an amendment to Article 3 of the Articles of Association to align with the 2025 Indonesian Standard Industrial Classification (KBLI 2025), and granting authority to the Board of Directors to take necessary actions, including notarial deeds and submissions to authorities. The decision was approved with a quorum of 79.76% and 99.99% in favor, with no votes against or abstentions."
